OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Tory leader Findlay says
OL,4,ASNP's indy 'obsession' is dangerously
OL,5,Airresponsible
OL,6,
OL,7,FFindlay told the Conservative Party's
OL,8,FUK conference that while the United
OL,9,FKingdom continues to face "grave
OL,10,Fthreats" from China, Russia and Iran, a
OL,11,Fdivided UK would be "a gift to our
OL,12,Fenemies".
OL,14,FAnd he called on Swinney to respect the
OL,15,Fresult of the 2014 referendum where a
OL,16,Fmajority of Scots voted no to
OL,17,Findependence.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
